938592d0f651ec.poster.avif?t=1665930458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914440/extras/cd067a59892c12611c938592d0f651ec.webm?t=1665930458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/914440/extras/cd067a59892c12611c938592d0f651ec.mp4?t=1665930458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Count me in!</h2><br>Please contact us if you have any problems, suggestions or feedback. We are very happy to launch Dear Home and we want you to have as much fun playing our game as we had fun creating it.",
